                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani AABBO Waaqi waan Yoshua ilma Nunitini jed'e, Garaa jabaad'i, ilaafiini. Siti gosa Israeli lafa anini worra kakhad'eti geesa, aninileeni suma woliini jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
